msgid "Visibility Configuration"
msgstr "可见性配置"

#: ../../source/0-overview/4-public_vs_internal.md:51
#: df2397fdec03419898179f795c894691
msgid ""
"The workspace uses `submodules_visibility.conf` to control which "
"**nested** submodules are public or private. The file is pipe-separated "
"(`parent_dir|relative_path|visibility`); blank lines and `#` comments are"
" ignored. It is not an INI file with `[public]` / `[private]` sections."
msgstr ""
"工作空间使用 `submodules_visibility.conf` "
"控制哪些**嵌套**子模块为公开或私有。文件为竖线分隔（`parent_dir|relative_path|visibility`）；空行和 "
"`#` 注释会被忽略。它不是带 `[public]` / `[private]` 小节的 INI 文件。"

#: ../../source/0-overview/4-public_vs_internal.md:53
#: eb994e7c19694eacb73dd6c4a5c2ea81
msgid ""
"# Format: parent_dir|relative_path|public or private\n"
"src/robot-descriptions|common|public\n"
"src/robot-descriptions|manipulator/Dobot|public\n"
"src/robot-descriptions|manipulator/Tianji|private\n"
"src/arms_ros2_control|controller/ocs2_wbc_controller|private"
msgstr ""
"# Format: parent_dir|relative_path|public or private\n"
"src/robot-descriptions|common|public\n"
"src/robot-descriptions|manipulator/Dobot|public\n"
"src/robot-descriptions|manipulator/Tianji|private\n"
"src/arms_ros2_control|controller/ocs2_wbc_controller|private"

#: ../../source/0-overview/4-public_vs_internal.md:61
#: 425dbb2742fa4862810ca3b738fde7ba
msgid ""
"The conf still marks `manipulator/Tianji` and `manipulator/Rokae` as "
"`private` for **init selection**. Those GitHub remotes ([robot-"
"descriptions-tianji](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"tianji), [robot-descriptions-rokae](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/robot-descriptions-rokae)) are public; `./init_repo.sh` still does "
"**not** pull them by default. See [Vendor "
"arms](../4-reference/descriptions/6-vendor_arms.md) and [Submodules "
"Visibility](../3-concepts/6-submodules_visibility.md)."
msgstr ""
"该配置仍把 `manipulator/Tianji` 与 `manipulator/Rokae` 标为 `private`，用于**初始化选择**。"
"那些 GitHub 远端（[robot-descriptions-tianji](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot-descriptions-tianji)、[robot-descriptions-rokae](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-rokae)）已公开；`./init_repo.sh` 仍**默认不会**拉取它们。"
"见 [厂商机械臂](../4-reference/descriptions/6-vendor_arms.md) 与 "
"[子模块可见性](../3-concepts/6-submodules_visibility.md)。"

